---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
import PixelLink from '../components/PixelLink.astro';
---
<Layout title="Electric Sheep — About" description="Meet Toby Balderson, the human behind Electric Sheep.">
  <div class="section-grid intro">
    <SectionLabel highlight="The human behind the sheep." />
    <span class="statement">Toby Balderson founded Electric Sheep in 2023 on a simple idea: technology should be built around people, not the other way round. The tools and automations he creates free his clients to do more of what they're best at.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="portrait">
    <div class="portrait__frame">
      <img src="/assets/images/toby.jpg" alt="Toby Balderson" />
      <div class="portrait__overlay">
      </div>
      <span class="portrait__caption">Big nose, bigger ideas.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="What he does" />
    <span class="text-section__body">Strategy, brand, UX and the plumbing behind them. Most studios do the pretty part or the technical part. Electric Sheep does both, because a brand that doesn't function is just decoration. If a robot can do the boring part, Toby will build the robot. The judgement stays human.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="Why sheep?" />
    <span class="text-section__body">Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep? Nobody knows. But naming a studio after the question felt honest. It's a reminder that the interesting part of technology was never the machines. It's what they free people up to do. Sheep by name. Not by nature.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="The studio" />
    <span class="text-section__body">10 Minden Street, St Helier, Jersey. The coffee is good. Toby accepts visitors by appointment.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="px-hover links">
    <PixelLink href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/toby-balderson-69b752164/" color="var(--text-primary)" fontSize={24}>Find Toby on LinkedIn</PixelLink>
    <PixelLink href="/contact" color="var(--text-primary)" fontSize={24}>Start a conversation</PixelLink>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  .intro {
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .rule-wrap {
    padding: 0 var(--page-margin);
  }
  .portrait {
    padding: 24px var(--page-margin) 16px var(--page-margin);
  }
  .portrait__frame {
    position: relative;
    height: 515px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--surface-placeholder);
  }
  .portrait__frame img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .portrait__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--overlay-protect);
  }
  .portrait__caption {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--card-pad);
    bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--es-cream);
  }
  .text-section {
    padding-top: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .text-section__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--text-section-label);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .links {
    padding: var(--section-pad) var(--page-margin);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
</style>
